# Local REST Client example (VS Code REST Client).
# Authentik is published on host port 9001. Sign in as the local administrator
# and create an expiring app password for the demo user john under
# Directory -> Tokens and App passwords. Supply it through the environment
# variable EMPLOYEE_APP_PASSWORD before starting the REST Client.
# Never paste a password or a returned bearer token into this tracked file.
@app_password = {{$processEnv EMPLOYEE_APP_PASSWORD}}

### Obtain a short-lived token from the local demo provider
# @name login
POST http://localhost:9001/application/o/token/
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username=john&password={{app_password}}&client_id=employee_api_client

### Use the preceding response without saving its token in this file
GET http://localhost:8089/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
